  (label "PV+" (at 644.00 197.08 270) (fields_autoplaced)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 2be01f13-90da-4610-9508-037155074f41))
  (text "Current paths" (at 20.00 290.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6adae0c6-bea1-42bc-9c8b-94abc956a335))
  (text "1. SUN-SENSOR LOOP: J1 -> D0 -> Q1 -> RSH1 -> GND (drawn in block 1)\n   Panel short-circuit current, ~1 ms every 10 s. Panel Isc 5.40 A (label), max ~6 A in cold strong sun.\n   A vertical panel peaks near 1.8 A at noon. The panel cannot supply more than its Isc.\n2. BOARD SUPPLY: PV+ -> F1 (2 A) -> D1 (3 A) -> buck -> +5V. Under 0.3 A. F1 and D1 are NOT in the measured path.\n3. AUX (optional): PV+ -> F4 (<= 3 A on v1; 9 A only with D5 on a heatsink) -> D5 -> J12. Never through the shunt.\nJ1 and J12 '>= 15 A' is the terminal and wire rating, not a measured current." (at 20.00 293.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 57b74f49-7504-4a0b-89ad-98f28c077fc5))
  (text "Measurement ranges" (at 20.00 320.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 374bd188-e4ef-4155-a6c7-b3fb7d6d9d43))
  (text "ISENSE (GPIO 35): RSH1 5 mOhm x INA180A3 gain 100 = 0.5 V/A. Range 0-6 A (pulsed); output clamps at 3.3 V (~6.6 A), harmless.\n   U2 IN+ and IN- are Kelvin traces from the inner ends of RSH1's pads (drawn as separate wires from the shunt).\nVDIV (GPIO 34): R1 100k / R2 4k7 = x 22.3. Voc 44.5 V -> 2.00 V; 48 V -> 2.15 V; 60 V -> 2.69 V. Firmware DIVIDER = (100 + 4.7) / 4.7." (at 20.00 323.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid b1e912d5-0182-42ff-a34d-35032def42c1))
  (text "ESP32 module and Q1 gate" (at 20.00 345.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ecafb24f-39ad-430d-87c2-9c45ee2812a1))
  (text "The ESP32 is a complete ELEGOO dev board plugged into J14/J15: EN pull-up, buttons, USB-serial and strapping are on that board.\nEN and GPIO 0, 1, 2, 3, 12, 15 are not brought out. GPIO 5 (strapping) is held high by R14.\nQ1 gate: U3 drives it when +5V exists; R21 (100k, gate-source) holds Q1 off before that, at dawn.\nD6 (TVS on PV+): footprint only; fitted if the v1 bench test shows turn-off overshoot. Then Q1 >= 100 V." (at 20.00 348.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 922c419f-5fa3-4c4e-a331-5d6f44444039))
